{#
  RET-C2-281 — Retail Demand Forecast Report System Prompt Template (Jinja2)

  Used by GenerateForecastSectionsNode (production LLM wiring).
  In v1 (SDK v1.0.0rc1) this template is loaded but section generation is
  performed deterministically over the computed analytics; the real LLM is
  wired in production to add the narrative layer over the same figures.

  Variables available to the template:
    {{ category }}                 — e.g. "Summer 2026 Apparel"
    {{ sku }}                      — e.g. "APP-SUM-0042" (may be empty)
    {{ forecast_horizon_weeks }}   — integer
    {{ demand_tier }}              — "high" | "medium" | "low"
    {{ trend_direction }}          — "up" | "down" | "flat"
    {{ trend_pct }}                — float (recent vs baseline)
    {{ avg_weekly_velocity }}      — float (units/week)
    {{ recent_velocity }}          — float (units/week)
    {{ projected_weekly_demand }}  — list of floats (per horizon week)
    {{ total_projected_demand }}   — float
    {{ safety_stock }}             — float
    {{ reorder_point }}            — float
    {{ recommended_buy_qty }}      — float
    {{ current_inventory }}        — integer
    {{ seasonality_flag }}         — boolean
